# Trivy ignore list for penguinm (see also .trivyignore.yaml + trivy.yaml for
# path-scoped metadata).
#
# SUPPRESSION POLICY (owner directive, 2026-09-08): a no-fix or upstream-blocked
# finding gets a TWO WEEK review-by date (`exp:YYYY-MM-DD` and
# `Review by <date>`), not a multi-month or open-ended one. When re-triaging,
# re-run `trivy fs` without `--ignorefile` (or after `exp:`) and verify whether
# upstream `semgrep` has relaxed its transitive dependency pins before
# extending.
#
# --- 1. semgrep transitive pins in tooling/security/requirements.txt ---------
# `semgrep` (checked through 1.184.0, latest on PyPI as of 2026-11-09; pinned
# at 1.179.0 in tooling/security/requirements.in) hard-pins `mcp==1.29.0` and
# `opentelemetry-api~=1.37.0` (`>=1.37.0,<1.38.0`) in its wheel metadata:
#   - mcp 1.29.0 carries four MEDIUM advisories (fixed in mcp 1.30.0 / 2.2.0):
#       CVE-2026-116684 (auth bypass via missing token audience validation)
#       CVE-2026-116685 (info disclosure via cross-origin HTTP redirects)
#       CVE-2026-116686 (DoS via schema reference resolution)
#       CVE-2026-59951  (DoS via session memory exhaustion in streamable HTTP)
#   - opentelemetry-api 1.37.0 carries one MEDIUM advisory (fixed in 1.45.1):
#       CVE-2026-114603 (DoS via regex backtracking in header parsing)
#
# Bumping either package in `tooling/security/requirements.in` is rejected by
# `uv pip compile` because every published `semgrep` release through 1.184.0
# declares `mcp==1.29.0` and `opentelemetry-api~=1.37.0`. Furthermore,
# `semgrep` is invoked strictly as a local/CI static-analysis CLI
# (`semgrep --config ... --error .`) — neither the MCP server transport nor
# OTel header parsing is reachable in this execution path.
#
# Added 2026-11-09. Review by 2026-11-23 — drop once upstream `semgrep` relaxes
# its `mcp` (>=1.30.0) and `opentelemetry-api` (>=1.45.1) version constraints.
CVE-2026-116684 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-116685 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-116686 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-59951 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-114603 exp:2026-11-23
